WEBVTT

01:37.670 --> 01:40.539
[Fate Chooses You]

01:41.320 --> 01:43.680
[Episode 29]

02:06.600 --> 02:08.419
[Tomb of My Mentor, Duan Xianyin]

02:09.840 --> 02:10.770
What's going on?

02:12.800 --> 02:13.590
It's Fan.

02:23.970 --> 02:26.850
[Liubo Temple]

02:27.050 --> 02:28.120
-Master!
-Master!

02:42.710 --> 02:43.560
What is this?

03:05.910 --> 03:06.430
Xin Mei.

03:09.560 --> 03:10.240
Senior.

03:11.280 --> 03:11.950
Senior!

03:36.030 --> 03:36.630
Senior.

03:37.560 --> 03:38.290
Are you okay?

03:39.800 --> 03:40.560
I'm fine.

03:44.079 --> 03:45.840
Your immortal perception is still here.

03:45.840 --> 03:48.500
They didn't extract
your immortal perception.

04:28.630 --> 04:29.910
There's a note for you.

04:38.870 --> 04:40.600
[Come to the pear tree
in Tongyu Alley quickly]

04:42.120 --> 04:42.830
Who sent it?

04:43.240 --> 04:43.970
I don't know.

04:44.120 --> 04:45.220
While I was out shopping,

04:45.220 --> 04:47.080
someone slipped it into my pouch.

04:49.780 --> 04:51.380
You didn't notice who it was?

05:17.000 --> 05:18.730
Eighty-year-old Suquan wine.

05:19.390 --> 05:21.120
You can't bear to spare me a cup?

05:24.510 --> 05:26.110
Everyone is looking for you,

05:27.000 --> 05:28.800
while you're here, all relaxed.

05:29.510 --> 05:31.390
I would have come even if
they weren't looking for me.

05:31.390 --> 05:33.120
Why do something unnecessary?

05:35.290 --> 05:36.610
What a boast.

05:39.310 --> 05:40.510
You sent me a message.

05:40.830 --> 05:43.230
Weren't you afraid I'd bring people along?

05:43.360 --> 05:44.159
You wouldn't.

05:44.600 --> 05:45.950
I have investigated you.

05:45.950 --> 05:47.880
You are Fu Tian's direct disciple.

05:47.960 --> 05:49.720
In the 10 years since you joined
the Qinghong Sect,

05:49.720 --> 05:50.460
you have become

05:50.460 --> 05:51.790
one of the Eight Vajras.

05:52.270 --> 05:53.970
Previously, at the Yunhan Inn,

05:53.970 --> 05:54.950
you and I joined forces

05:54.950 --> 05:56.480
to kill Dharma King Wenyin.

05:57.270 --> 05:58.190
Back then, I thought you were

05:58.190 --> 05:59.560
just fighting among yourselves.

05:59.560 --> 06:01.600
But later at the paper mill,

06:02.040 --> 06:03.570
you gave me hints in secret.

06:04.390 --> 06:05.560
I really want to know

06:06.120 --> 06:07.510
why you betrayed Fu Tian

06:08.110 --> 06:09.000
to help me.

06:12.510 --> 06:13.720
Why did I help you?

06:14.720 --> 06:15.580
Don't you know?

06:19.120 --> 06:20.240
Because I like you.

06:22.720 --> 06:24.040
You are good-looking,

06:24.920 --> 06:26.040
smart, handsome,

06:26.800 --> 06:28.070
and very prudish.

06:28.920 --> 06:29.830
I...

06:30.390 --> 06:32.270
like men like you.

06:33.510 --> 06:34.310
Why don't you

06:35.470 --> 06:36.830
stop looking for that stubborn girl

06:36.830 --> 06:38.120
from Xin Xie Manor

06:39.510 --> 06:40.920
and be a couple with me

06:41.310 --> 06:41.950
instead?

06:43.560 --> 06:44.820
I'm smart, beautiful,

06:45.070 --> 06:46.360
and younger than her.

06:47.120 --> 06:48.190
Moreover,

06:49.190 --> 06:50.920
I am sensible and interesting.

06:51.380 --> 06:53.790
Unlike her, she's so reckless

06:54.510 --> 06:56.040
and causes a lot of trouble.

06:58.190 --> 06:59.040
You like me?

07:00.830 --> 07:02.230
It's love at first sight.

07:02.680 --> 07:04.600
No wonder you wrote to Chu Ying,

07:04.830 --> 07:06.600
notifying him to come and save me.

07:06.600 --> 07:09.120
You must really love me

07:09.720 --> 07:12.070
and have never set me up before.

07:14.920 --> 07:16.430
You really came prepared.

07:18.630 --> 07:19.430
That's right.

07:19.870 --> 07:20.950
I did it.

07:21.830 --> 07:23.360
Since you investigated me,

07:23.490 --> 07:24.450
did you discover

07:24.750 --> 07:26.350
Qinghong Sect's big secret?

07:27.680 --> 07:28.270
Secret?

07:31.240 --> 07:32.500
Man lives but one life,

07:32.680 --> 07:34.810
like a plant lives through one autumn.

07:34.830 --> 07:37.120
Time flies and is ruthless.

07:37.830 --> 07:40.630
Who in this world
doesn't want to be extraordinary

07:41.040 --> 07:43.060
and transcend the cycle of life and death?

07:43.060 --> 07:44.990
But without immortal perception,

07:45.040 --> 07:47.370
you cannot enter the door of cultivation.

07:47.720 --> 07:49.430
Even if you are an emperor or general

07:49.430 --> 07:50.830
holding absolute power,

07:50.880 --> 07:52.080
or a wealthy merchant

07:52.310 --> 07:53.440
owning vast riches,

07:54.000 --> 07:55.430
as long as you have
no immortal perception,

07:55.430 --> 07:56.630
you are destined to be

07:56.680 --> 07:57.950
a mortal in this life.

08:01.000 --> 08:02.430
Do you want to know how Fu Tian

08:02.430 --> 08:04.360
took less than a century

08:04.750 --> 08:05.920
to make Qinghong Sect

08:05.920 --> 08:07.850
the number one sect in North Xiang?

08:11.070 --> 08:12.310
Because he has a way

08:12.920 --> 08:15.040
to let ordinary people without
immortal perception

08:15.040 --> 08:16.240
cross the vast chasm,

08:16.510 --> 08:17.910
enter the immortal sect,

08:18.160 --> 08:19.560
and become cultivators.

08:31.800 --> 08:32.260
Master.

08:42.390 --> 08:43.850
Regardless of your gender

08:43.960 --> 08:44.960
or your aptitude,

08:45.150 --> 08:46.480
as long as he is willing,

08:46.510 --> 08:47.840
he can make you break through

08:47.840 --> 08:48.910
your limits overnight,

08:48.910 --> 08:51.170
refine your form, and grant you rebirth.

08:51.670 --> 08:53.480
Mortals can become cultivators,

08:53.480 --> 08:55.910
and cultivators
can also nourish themselves

08:55.910 --> 08:57.310
to elevate their realms.

09:22.480 --> 09:23.540
Thank you, Master.

09:27.360 --> 09:27.910
Aren't you curious

09:27.910 --> 09:29.200
about how he did it?

09:30.870 --> 09:32.390
That's such an important secret.

09:32.390 --> 09:33.050
If I ask you,

09:33.510 --> 09:34.440
will you tell me?

09:35.530 --> 09:37.530
There's nothing that can't be said.

09:37.720 --> 09:39.780
I just want you to see it for yourself.

09:40.240 --> 09:41.390
It's a grand matter.

09:41.870 --> 09:43.270
It'd be a pity if you don't

09:43.630 --> 09:44.890
witness it firsthand.

09:45.600 --> 09:48.000
You don't have immortal perception either?

09:48.000 --> 09:49.800
All members of the Qinghong Sect

09:50.000 --> 09:52.260
were transformed from ordinary people.

09:52.550 --> 09:55.150
Cultivators are not trusted.

09:56.390 --> 09:57.000
Why?

09:57.630 --> 09:59.270
Because Fu Tian believes that

09:59.270 --> 10:01.400
only those who have truly been mortals

10:01.830 --> 10:03.960
can genuinely hate the immortal sect.

10:04.270 --> 10:05.750
Only when a moral body

10:05.960 --> 10:07.600
crosses the boundary
between immortals and mortals

10:07.600 --> 10:09.600
can one be firmly controlled by him.

10:11.200 --> 10:12.730
But you still betrayed him.

10:13.150 --> 10:13.840
Betray him?

10:14.960 --> 10:16.600
That sounds too harsh.

10:19.480 --> 10:20.200
It seems

10:20.960 --> 10:23.000
you still don't understand Qinghong Sect.

10:23.000 --> 10:24.200
Take me, for example.

10:24.390 --> 10:26.840
I grew up in Qinghong Sect
since I was a child.

10:26.840 --> 10:28.390
From the first day Fu Tian brought me back

10:28.390 --> 10:30.000
to Qinghong Sect,

10:30.510 --> 10:31.360
he told me

10:31.890 --> 10:33.650
that my parents and clansmen

10:34.270 --> 10:36.330
were all killed by the immortal sect.

10:36.510 --> 10:37.270
I am an orphan

10:37.270 --> 10:38.670
bearing a blood feud.

10:38.870 --> 10:40.270
Haven't you ever doubted

10:40.510 --> 10:42.970
whether what Fu Tian said
was right or wrong?

10:44.200 --> 10:46.030
That's why I said you don't understand.

10:46.030 --> 10:47.030
In Qinghong Sect,

10:47.480 --> 10:48.440
there are many children

10:48.440 --> 10:49.270
just like me.

10:50.720 --> 10:51.670
Everyone is deeply immersed

10:51.670 --> 10:53.150
in the same hatred.

10:53.690 --> 10:55.020
Under such conditions,

10:55.150 --> 10:57.290
discipline is most easily implemented.

10:57.290 --> 10:58.080
Everyone is working hard

10:58.080 --> 10:59.340
towards the same goal,

10:59.580 --> 11:00.190
foolishly

11:00.670 --> 11:02.200
yet firmly.

11:03.200 --> 11:05.730
They work their fingers to the bone
every day.

11:05.870 --> 11:08.200
Everyone calls me a demonic enchantress.

11:08.200 --> 11:09.910
I also like this title myself.

11:11.000 --> 11:13.460
I even mocked them
for being short-sighted,

11:13.830 --> 11:16.200
unable to discern
good from evil in this world,

11:16.200 --> 11:18.730
or notice the hypocrisy
of the immortal sect.

11:20.390 --> 11:21.440
Until one day,

11:22.000 --> 11:22.860
I found out that

11:23.310 --> 11:26.510
Qinghong Sect was sending medicine
to the immortal sect.

11:27.910 --> 11:28.770
What medicine?

11:32.750 --> 11:34.280
You must have seen this too.

11:36.250 --> 11:39.310
The Yangyuan Pill
commonly eaten by the immortal sect?

11:41.270 --> 11:42.070
That's right.

11:42.630 --> 11:44.150
They often use this medicine

11:44.150 --> 11:46.750
to increase their skills,
repair their Qihai,

11:46.790 --> 11:48.250
and nourish their bodies.

11:56.910 --> 11:58.040
Why do you have this?

11:58.390 --> 11:59.000
I got this

11:59.000 --> 12:00.330
from the Bishui Branch.

12:00.840 --> 12:01.840
At that time, the Branch Master

12:01.840 --> 12:03.240
drank this golden liquid

12:03.360 --> 12:04.750
and improved his skills greatly.

12:04.750 --> 12:06.270
He even advanced on the spot.

12:06.270 --> 12:07.550
I once asked Su Taiyi

12:07.830 --> 12:09.240
about the origin of this golden liquid.

12:09.240 --> 12:10.790
He said it had similar ingredients

12:10.790 --> 12:11.990
to the Yangyuan Pill.

12:12.750 --> 12:13.670
Not similar.

12:14.480 --> 12:16.280
They are exactly the same thing.

12:16.600 --> 12:17.660
This golden liquid

12:17.800 --> 12:19.240
is extracted from the immortal perception

12:19.240 --> 12:20.170
of cultivators.

12:20.670 --> 12:22.440
The higher the cultivator's realm,

12:22.440 --> 12:23.720
the purer the extracted golden liquid,

12:23.720 --> 12:24.670
and the greater

12:25.150 --> 12:26.480
the energy it provides.

12:26.670 --> 12:27.730
The Yangyuan Pills

12:27.960 --> 12:29.870
are simply pills made from very diluted

12:29.870 --> 12:31.000
golden liquid.

12:31.670 --> 12:32.470
So,

12:33.030 --> 12:33.830
Qinghong Sect

12:33.840 --> 12:35.480
is extracting golden liquid

12:35.750 --> 12:37.240
from the immortal perception
of cultivators.

12:37.240 --> 12:38.200
A portion of it

12:38.630 --> 12:41.080
is used to transform
mortals into cultivators,

12:41.080 --> 12:42.390
while the other portion

12:42.390 --> 12:43.870
is made into Yangyuan Pills

12:43.870 --> 12:45.670
and resold to the immortal sect.

12:46.870 --> 12:48.400
Sounds ridiculous, right?

12:49.170 --> 12:51.170
Claiming to hate the immortal sect,

12:51.550 --> 12:53.200
but wanting to become the immortal sect

12:53.200 --> 12:54.080
and rely on it.

12:54.870 --> 12:56.080
Many of my friends

12:56.440 --> 12:57.630
died while fighting

12:57.630 --> 12:58.900
against the immortal sect.

12:58.900 --> 13:00.020
If Qinghong Sect

13:00.480 --> 13:02.200
is a vassal of the immortal sect...

13:02.200 --> 13:03.630
If everything is fake,

13:04.200 --> 13:06.510
then what about the people who died?

13:09.300 --> 13:10.610
Lord Baori of our sect

13:10.920 --> 13:13.980
is someone sent by
the immortal sect of Central Plains.

13:16.510 --> 13:17.240
Lu Qianqiao.

13:19.030 --> 13:20.430
I know you are a War Demon.

13:20.870 --> 13:22.270
After the Battle of Pinghu,

13:22.270 --> 13:23.870
the War Demons disappeared.

13:24.180 --> 13:25.780
You are a loner now.

13:26.750 --> 13:28.270
You don't belong to the War Demons,

13:28.270 --> 13:29.270
the Human Race,

13:29.600 --> 13:31.660
and certainly not the immortal sect.

13:32.720 --> 13:33.630
These years,

13:34.500 --> 13:35.360
I suppose your life

13:35.360 --> 13:36.760
hasn't been easy either.

13:37.390 --> 13:38.900
You should understand the feeling

13:38.900 --> 13:40.000
of working hard for a goal

13:40.000 --> 13:41.000
since childhood,

13:41.670 --> 13:42.530
only to find out

13:43.330 --> 13:44.330
in the end that

13:44.360 --> 13:45.840
everything is a scam.

13:46.720 --> 13:48.600
I, Zuo Yingying, considered myself smart,

13:48.600 --> 13:49.840
but I was deceived,

13:50.240 --> 13:50.750
lied to,

13:51.390 --> 13:52.990
and played for a fool by them.

13:54.050 --> 13:54.850
Why?

13:57.910 --> 13:59.110
What do you want to do?

13:59.480 --> 14:00.360
I want to try.

14:01.630 --> 14:02.200
Try what?

14:02.840 --> 14:03.720
I want to try

14:05.200 --> 14:06.510
to kill Fu Tian,

14:07.440 --> 14:08.970
destroy the Qinghong Sect,

14:09.390 --> 14:11.520
and break this cage that imprisons me.

14:14.790 --> 14:15.520
How about it?

14:17.000 --> 14:18.130
Shall we cooperate?

14:19.070 --> 14:21.000
It won't be the first time, anyway.

14:24.730 --> 14:27.990
[Phoenix City]

14:24.870 --> 14:27.350
Phoenix City is 1 of the 3 towns
in the Western Regions.

14:27.350 --> 14:29.480
It connects Mohe to the east,
Banchi to the west,

14:29.480 --> 14:30.750
and Xiongshan to the south.

14:30.750 --> 14:31.480
Since ancient times,

14:31.480 --> 14:33.670
it has been a prosperous place for trade.

14:33.670 --> 14:34.870
After the Battle of Pinghu,

14:34.870 --> 14:35.550
the Emperor of the Human Race

14:35.550 --> 14:37.080
took the opportunity
to recover Phoenix City

14:37.080 --> 14:39.080
and sent soldiers to garrison here.

14:39.150 --> 14:40.200
Nominally, Phoenix City

14:40.200 --> 14:41.720
is under the jurisdiction
of the Central Plains.

14:41.720 --> 14:42.510
But in fact,

14:43.010 --> 14:44.480
the Qinghong Sect has infiltrated

14:44.480 --> 14:45.480
every corner.

14:46.000 --> 14:47.360
Once the people of the Wushuang Society
and the immortal sect

14:47.360 --> 14:48.560
step into this place,

14:48.850 --> 14:49.670
they will be within

14:49.670 --> 14:50.720
our line of sight.

14:51.240 --> 14:53.000
Then why did you let them

14:53.360 --> 14:54.890
burn down the Sihe Library?

14:55.360 --> 14:56.960
Because it's not important.

14:56.970 --> 14:57.720
The people of the Wushuang Society

14:57.720 --> 14:59.240
care about the Unparalleled Secret Magic.

14:59.240 --> 15:01.240
But the Qinghong Sect is different.

15:01.270 --> 15:03.030
Although we have no immortal perception,

15:03.030 --> 15:05.290
we also practice the art of cultivation.

15:06.270 --> 15:08.330
The Qinghong Sect members
practice with secret methods,

15:08.330 --> 15:09.600
vainly attempting to use mortal bodies

15:09.600 --> 15:10.910
to become immortals and saints.

15:10.910 --> 15:12.240
From this perspective,

15:12.240 --> 15:14.440
the Wushuang Society is also our enemy.

15:19.270 --> 15:21.030
Then why did you collect ancient books

15:21.030 --> 15:22.560
and build the Sihe Library?

15:23.390 --> 15:24.650
Because that's a trap.

15:25.080 --> 15:26.960
As long as the Sihe Library is there,

15:26.960 --> 15:28.220
groups of people from the Wushuang Society

15:28.220 --> 15:29.950
will come here.

15:30.870 --> 15:31.870
As long as they come,

15:31.870 --> 15:33.960
the immortal sect members will come after.

15:33.960 --> 15:35.550
There is a saying in the Central Plains:

15:35.550 --> 15:37.840
the mantis stalks the cicada,
unaware of the oriole behind.

15:37.840 --> 15:38.900
That's exactly it.

15:41.840 --> 15:42.790
After the immortal sect members

15:42.790 --> 15:44.750
and your group
wounded each other in battle,

15:44.750 --> 15:46.790
our people took the opportunity to act.

15:46.790 --> 15:47.600
Now, most of them

15:47.600 --> 15:49.660
are locked in the dungeon of our sect,

15:49.750 --> 15:50.790
including Xin Mei,

15:50.790 --> 15:51.750
her junior,

15:52.240 --> 15:53.910
and your swordsman friend.

15:55.790 --> 15:57.520
Lord of Rust-Sword isn't dead?

15:58.910 --> 15:59.630
Not at all.

16:00.550 --> 16:01.480
He's very lucky.

16:03.270 --> 16:04.320
Can you help me

16:04.550 --> 16:05.480
save them?

16:06.440 --> 16:08.830
Master is certain
you'd go back to save them,

16:08.830 --> 16:10.030
and has set up an inescapable trap

16:10.030 --> 16:10.630
for you.

16:11.450 --> 16:12.720
He also sent his Right Protector,

16:12.720 --> 16:14.650
Lord Tiling, to guard the dungeon.

16:14.960 --> 16:16.960
He's a cultivator in the Void Stage.

16:17.120 --> 16:18.320
With such a huge risk,

16:18.390 --> 16:19.590
why should I help you?

16:20.320 --> 16:22.480
I will help you kill Fu Tian,

16:22.720 --> 16:24.030
destroy the Qinghong Sect,

16:24.030 --> 16:26.030
and break the cage imprisoning you.

16:26.550 --> 16:27.390
By yourself?

16:28.720 --> 16:29.650
What do you mean?

16:30.080 --> 16:31.080
Am I not also here?

16:33.080 --> 16:34.080
What's your plan?

16:35.720 --> 16:36.550
Three days later,

16:36.550 --> 16:39.080
Qinghong Sect will be holding
the ritual assembly.

16:39.080 --> 16:41.000
I heard Fu Tian will recruit disciples

16:41.000 --> 16:42.480
into the sect at the assembly.

16:42.480 --> 16:43.480
According to you,

16:43.870 --> 16:45.690
he'll use his secret arts
to help ordinary mortals

16:45.690 --> 16:46.980
cross the boundary
between mortals and immortals

16:46.980 --> 16:49.440
and step into
the Cultivation Realm, right?

16:50.650 --> 16:53.170
I will kill him in public that day.

17:01.700 --> 17:02.290
Come in.

18:13.880 --> 18:14.440
How is it?

18:17.350 --> 18:18.680
What about you, Senior?

18:22.450 --> 18:23.590
They used the Nine Breaths Technique

18:23.590 --> 18:25.960
to seal off our acupoints
and nine apertures.

18:25.960 --> 18:26.590
They severed our connection

18:26.590 --> 18:29.050
to the spiritual energy
of heaven and earth.

18:29.180 --> 18:30.310
Even if I forcefully activate

18:30.310 --> 18:32.030
the spiritual energy in my body,

18:32.030 --> 18:34.000
it will soon be suppressed and sealed.

18:34.000 --> 18:35.730
I can't break through it at all.

18:44.720 --> 18:45.270
Break!

18:46.760 --> 18:47.410
Break!

18:49.000 --> 18:49.480
Break!

18:51.000 --> 18:51.480
Break!

18:52.350 --> 18:52.880
Break!

18:58.110 --> 18:59.030
Even if you trigger

18:59.030 --> 19:00.750
all the power in the formation,

19:00.750 --> 19:02.480
you still can't break the seal.

19:02.510 --> 19:03.400
And it might cause

19:03.400 --> 19:04.480
the two forces to clash,

19:04.480 --> 19:05.590
making it backfire on you

19:05.590 --> 19:06.850
and cost you your life.

19:07.070 --> 19:08.270
Then what do we do now?

19:08.310 --> 19:09.440
Just wait for death?

19:10.480 --> 19:11.480
Watch your tone.

19:12.110 --> 19:13.030
If I had known,

19:13.650 --> 19:14.590
I would have learned more from my father

19:14.590 --> 19:16.590
about the formation to break seals.

19:16.750 --> 19:18.240
Then we wouldn't be

19:18.640 --> 19:20.400
sitting ducks like this today.

19:30.510 --> 19:31.170
How are you?

19:33.440 --> 19:34.960
If my Divine Sword were here,

19:34.960 --> 19:35.880
I'd have been able to

19:35.880 --> 19:37.410
gather qi with my sword will

19:37.480 --> 19:38.880
and break this damn seal.

19:39.790 --> 19:41.050
If my father were here,

19:41.870 --> 19:43.590
the people outside would be dead by now.

19:43.590 --> 19:44.550
How pointless.

20:05.550 --> 20:08.000
Slower. I told you to be slower.

20:08.030 --> 20:09.110
You're still too fast.

20:09.110 --> 20:10.550
You need to be slower.

20:10.680 --> 20:11.920
Even slower?

20:21.760 --> 20:23.610
Can such a weak move

20:23.960 --> 20:24.960
even hit anyone?

20:28.590 --> 20:29.660
The path of cultivation

20:29.660 --> 20:32.240
is about understanding the Dao
and practicing methods,

20:32.240 --> 20:34.920
gathering qi and condensing power
to defeat the enemy.

20:34.920 --> 20:36.920
The key is that you must understand

20:37.070 --> 20:38.480
what Dao you cultivate,

20:38.590 --> 20:39.880
what method you practice,

20:39.880 --> 20:40.940
what qi you gather,

20:41.000 --> 20:43.000
and what power you utilize.

20:44.680 --> 20:45.870
Master, you once said that

20:45.870 --> 20:46.890
we righteous cultivators

20:46.890 --> 20:48.650
cultivate the Dao of Heaven,

20:48.830 --> 20:51.200
gather the qi of the five elements,
and utilize pure spiritual power.

20:51.200 --> 20:52.270
The path of cultivation

20:52.270 --> 20:54.200
is a path of defying heaven
to fight for life.

20:54.200 --> 20:56.550
Remember not to just memorize by rote.

20:57.680 --> 20:59.070
Please enlighten me, Master.

20:59.070 --> 21:00.310
As for the Dao of Heaven,

21:00.310 --> 21:01.270
I will properly explain them to you

21:01.270 --> 21:02.640
another day.

21:03.310 --> 21:05.350
Today, I'll first tell you about

21:06.000 --> 21:07.550
the qi of the five elements.

21:08.160 --> 21:11.490
The qi of the five elements
is divided into clear and turbid.

21:11.790 --> 21:14.160
Clear qi is pure and immaculate.

21:14.200 --> 21:15.680
The more you absorb,

21:15.700 --> 21:16.980
the stronger the spiritual power

21:16.980 --> 21:18.220
you condense.

21:19.590 --> 21:20.590
And the turbid qi?

21:20.720 --> 21:23.510
Turbid qi is chaotic and uncontrollable.

21:23.720 --> 21:25.810
If you accidentally
inhale the slightest bit,

21:25.810 --> 21:27.440
it will corrode your immortal perception,

21:27.440 --> 21:29.420
making it impossible for your cultivation

21:29.420 --> 21:30.770
to improve any further.

21:31.240 --> 21:32.430
Is there no one in this world

21:32.430 --> 21:34.290
who mainly cultivates turbid qi?

21:34.400 --> 21:36.000
There are.
Heretical cultivator, for example.

21:36.000 --> 21:37.160
Of course, they have almost been wiped out

21:37.160 --> 21:38.830
by me.

21:41.160 --> 21:42.490
But I don't understand.

21:42.830 --> 21:44.980
Both types belong
to the qi of the five elements.

21:44.980 --> 21:46.720
Why are those
who mainly cultivate turbid qi

21:46.720 --> 21:48.060
called heretical cultivators?

21:48.060 --> 21:50.310
That's because
they are eager for quick success

21:50.310 --> 21:51.220
and have improper intentions.

21:51.220 --> 21:53.150
It has nothing to do with turbid qi.

21:54.640 --> 21:55.680
So does that mean

21:55.880 --> 21:57.160
turbid qi can also

21:57.160 --> 21:58.700
condense into powerful spiritual energy?

21:58.700 --> 22:00.920
Yin alone cannot exist;
Yang alone cannot grow.

22:00.920 --> 22:03.070
In theory, this is true.

22:03.200 --> 22:04.510
But no one in this world

22:04.510 --> 22:05.750
can successfully cultivate turbid qi,

22:05.750 --> 22:07.950
nor can anyone use it to prove their Dao.

22:09.720 --> 22:10.480
My disciple,

22:10.830 --> 22:12.070
remember this.

22:13.400 --> 22:15.440
All things share the same source.

22:15.880 --> 22:18.340
Heaven and earth are originally connected.

22:18.350 --> 22:20.160
Absorbing clear qi is the foundation.

22:20.160 --> 22:22.510
The state of mind has no beginning or end.

22:23.350 --> 22:25.400
Clouds roll and unroll.

22:25.480 --> 22:27.340
Wind comes and goes in emptiness.

22:27.680 --> 22:29.640
Firmly guard the true original intent.

22:29.640 --> 22:31.720
Do not let the turbid become a flood.

22:57.590 --> 22:59.590
Senior, did you think of something?

23:00.930 --> 23:01.830
The Nine Breaths Technique

23:01.830 --> 23:03.290
has used the Five Elements

23:03.400 --> 23:04.110
to sever our connection

23:04.110 --> 23:05.790
with heaven and earth's spiritual power.

23:05.790 --> 23:06.310
But,

23:07.110 --> 23:08.030
it has only sealed

23:08.030 --> 23:10.030
our spiritual energy from clear qi.

23:15.240 --> 23:16.300
Isn't that enough?

23:19.680 --> 23:20.970
Under the vast Dao of Heaven,

23:20.970 --> 23:22.200
it's not like we can only gather

23:22.200 --> 23:23.400
clear qi into energy.

23:23.830 --> 23:25.240
What if I do the opposite?

23:25.880 --> 23:26.750
You mean,

23:27.160 --> 23:28.290
we can turn turbid qi

23:28.780 --> 23:29.980
into energy instead?

23:30.160 --> 23:30.690
Exactly.

23:31.480 --> 23:32.000
No.

23:34.440 --> 23:36.240
Do you have a better idea, Sheng?

23:37.520 --> 23:38.960
Then let me take the risk.

23:39.510 --> 23:40.400
Among us,

23:41.200 --> 23:42.030
I’m the only one

23:42.030 --> 23:43.490
at the Nascent Soul Stage.

23:43.790 --> 23:44.310
So,

23:44.920 --> 23:46.480
if we want to expel the clear
and gather the turbid,

23:46.480 --> 23:47.880
I have the highest chance

23:48.070 --> 23:49.270
of breaking the seal.

23:50.410 --> 23:51.940
What are you arguing about?

23:52.880 --> 23:54.480
When heaven and earth were created,

23:54.480 --> 23:55.880
mountains stood, and rivers flowed.

23:55.880 --> 23:57.870
The two qis operated wonderfully within,

23:57.870 --> 23:59.470
parallel without conflict.

23:59.590 --> 24:01.720
The light and clear yang qi
rose to become heaven,

24:01.720 --> 24:03.680
while the heavy and turbid yin qi
sank to become earth.

24:03.680 --> 24:05.480
Where qi gathers in abundance,
conception occurs.

24:05.480 --> 24:07.270
Where qi comes alive and stirs,
nurturing begins.

24:07.270 --> 24:08.750
Where qi fuses and binds,
the fetus takes form.

24:08.750 --> 24:11.240
Where qi briefly comes to rest,
breath is drawn.

24:11.240 --> 24:12.160
Yin and yang

24:12.510 --> 24:13.970
represent death and life,

24:14.070 --> 24:15.070
clear and turbid.

24:15.510 --> 24:16.790
They complement each other

24:16.790 --> 24:18.000
and are born together.

24:18.000 --> 24:19.310
But during cultivation,

24:19.310 --> 24:20.720
one must reject the turbid
and accept the clear

24:20.720 --> 24:22.050
to enrich their origin,

24:22.270 --> 24:23.310
fuel the cycle,

24:23.830 --> 24:25.490
and generate endless energy.

24:26.680 --> 24:27.240
So,

24:27.790 --> 24:28.830
in simple terms,

24:29.000 --> 24:30.130
what does that mean?

24:30.510 --> 24:31.590
Ignorant.

24:32.350 --> 24:33.160
Xin Mei is planning

24:33.160 --> 24:34.220
to do the opposite.

24:34.640 --> 24:36.360
She plans to absorb the turbid qi here,

24:36.360 --> 24:37.880
turn it into power,

24:38.510 --> 24:40.310
break the seal from the outside,

24:40.880 --> 24:41.790
and lift the Nine Breaths Technique

24:41.790 --> 24:43.190
that is trapping us here.

24:44.640 --> 24:45.970
Isn't that a good thing?

24:47.310 --> 24:49.840
But turbid qi is chaotic
and uncontrollable.

24:50.070 --> 24:51.400
One mistake, and it will

24:51.440 --> 24:52.830
corrode her immortal perception,

24:52.830 --> 24:56.030
making it impossible for her
to improve her cultivation.

24:56.270 --> 24:57.030
Senior.

24:57.640 --> 24:58.480
Let me try.

25:00.640 --> 25:01.270
Sheng.

25:02.160 --> 25:03.000
I am already

25:03.000 --> 25:04.530
a Nascent Soul cultivator.

25:05.050 --> 25:06.770
So many people can never reach

25:07.200 --> 25:09.210
the Nascent Soul stage in their lifetime.

25:09.210 --> 25:10.670
I am already very content.

25:13.720 --> 25:15.830
The Qinghong Sect
has malicious intentions.

25:15.830 --> 25:17.490
Not only did they imprison us,

25:17.680 --> 25:20.050
but they also had ulterior
motives for Lu Qianqiao.

25:20.050 --> 25:20.880
Our lives may be in danger

25:20.880 --> 25:21.920
at any moment.

25:22.200 --> 25:24.060
We must escape from here quickly.

25:44.790 --> 25:47.440
That person seems to be
from the Wang family of Jinqiu.

25:47.440 --> 25:48.680
Why is he here?

25:53.240 --> 25:54.430
You are good at formations.

25:54.430 --> 25:55.960
Can you set one up to help me?

25:57.430 --> 25:57.830
No.

25:58.510 --> 26:00.040
This method is too harmful.

26:00.090 --> 26:01.750
I can't set you up for failure.

26:01.920 --> 26:02.610
Tell me.

26:05.480 --> 26:06.790
The conditions to activate this formation

26:06.790 --> 26:08.050
are extremely strict.

26:08.110 --> 26:09.310
I have never tried it.

26:09.480 --> 26:10.110
I don't even know

26:10.110 --> 26:11.040
if I can succeed.

26:11.550 --> 26:12.250
First,

26:12.590 --> 26:13.640
we need to gather the impure variations

26:13.640 --> 26:14.770
of the five elements

26:14.880 --> 26:16.080
and turbid qi itself.

26:35.990 --> 26:38.200
Foul stagnant water can be impure water.

26:38.200 --> 26:40.730
Filthy soil from a prison
can be impure earth.

26:41.550 --> 26:43.070
Then we still need impure metal,

26:43.070 --> 26:43.800
impure wood,

26:43.910 --> 26:44.840
and impure fire.

26:46.200 --> 26:47.000
Does qi count?

26:47.830 --> 26:48.310
Yes.

26:49.070 --> 26:50.130
Will sword qi work?

26:50.960 --> 26:52.360
Sword qi is indeed metal,

26:52.680 --> 26:54.210
but it must be impure metal.

26:54.350 --> 26:55.550
What is impure metal?

26:55.750 --> 26:56.880
Generally speaking,

26:56.880 --> 26:58.440
anything tainted with resentment,

26:58.440 --> 26:58.880
anger,

26:59.310 --> 26:59.960
decay,

27:00.510 --> 27:02.070
sorrow, disaster,

27:02.400 --> 27:06.200
obscenity, cruelty, pain, disease,

27:06.440 --> 27:08.170
murderous intent, and the like

27:08.200 --> 27:09.730
can be called impure metal.

27:11.160 --> 27:12.350
Are impure wood and impure fire

27:12.350 --> 27:13.270
the same?

27:14.510 --> 27:15.160
Yes.

27:15.830 --> 27:17.270
I can summon the Divine Sword

27:17.270 --> 27:18.680
to arouse
the murderous intent in my heart.

27:18.680 --> 27:20.610
A murderous blade would be impure.

27:20.680 --> 27:21.940
I will handle the fire.

27:22.030 --> 27:24.230
A resentful fire is considered impure.

27:24.310 --> 27:25.550
Then I will handle the wood.

27:25.550 --> 27:27.680
A decaying dead wood is considered impure.

27:27.680 --> 27:28.240
Okay.

27:28.830 --> 27:30.030
Then we have them all.

27:39.130 --> 27:40.410
Master has arrived!

27:43.920 --> 27:45.790
Welcome, Master.

28:54.750 --> 28:57.990
♪ Pointing to the sky,
questioning the moon ♪

28:58.010 --> 29:01.270
♪ I'd rather be a wandering immortal
in the mortal world ♪

29:01.540 --> 29:04.770
♪ And experience it all for myself ♪

29:04.910 --> 29:08.260
♪ Right and wrong, justice and evil ♪

29:08.320 --> 29:11.500
♪ In all the world,
I choose first the people ♪

29:08.880 --> 29:10.200
The murderous blade you gathered

29:10.200 --> 29:10.860
is too weak.

29:11.310 --> 29:12.110
I can't form the formation this way.

29:12.110 --> 29:14.960
♪ How could the powerful lie drunk
in golden halls ♪

29:15.250 --> 29:18.250
♪ Illusions of heaven
and memory entwined ♪

29:18.590 --> 29:20.500
♪ I will still break
into this mortal realm ♪

29:20.750 --> 29:22.960
♪ To demand a rightful ending ♪

29:33.310 --> 29:35.030
Greetings, Master.

29:35.680 --> 29:38.830
May the Sect Leader
shine as eternal as the sun and moon.

29:39.310 --> 29:42.680
May the Sect Leader
share the glory of heaven and earth.

29:43.480 --> 29:44.270
Today

29:44.960 --> 29:46.890
is the birthday of the Phoenix God,

29:47.160 --> 29:50.240
and also an auspicious day

29:50.750 --> 29:52.880
when the Phoenix God descends to bless

29:53.070 --> 29:54.270
all living beings.

29:54.880 --> 29:57.640
The Phoenix God traverses heaven and earth

29:58.000 --> 29:59.260
as the Lord of all gods.

29:59.790 --> 30:02.590
We should follow the Phoenix God

30:03.310 --> 30:06.510
to eradicate all evil in the world,

30:07.310 --> 30:09.270
achieve unprecedented feats,

30:09.720 --> 30:11.550
be granted righteous status,

30:11.920 --> 30:15.630
and ascend to heaven
to live forever with the Dao.

30:16.440 --> 30:19.830
Dao of Heaven, may we never age.

30:20.400 --> 30:24.000
Live as long as the earth,
and ascend to heaven soon.

30:24.350 --> 30:27.550
May my life be prolonged
to live forever with the Dao.

30:27.880 --> 30:31.440
May my life be prolonged
to live forever with the Dao.

30:53.750 --> 30:54.810
Greetings, Vajra.

30:55.610 --> 30:57.880
Today, the sect is holding
a blessing ceremony.

30:57.880 --> 31:00.160
To prevent scoundrels from
the immortal sect from causing trouble,

31:00.160 --> 31:01.560
you must be on full alert.

31:01.580 --> 31:02.510
Do not slack off.

31:03.000 --> 31:03.550
Yes.

32:28.790 --> 32:29.590
Are you ready?

32:30.750 --> 32:32.470
I am going to start the formation.

32:32.470 --> 32:33.130
Bring it on.

32:34.970 --> 32:36.790
The Five Elements are born,
each with its own nature.

32:36.790 --> 32:38.750
Their essences miraculously
combine and condense.

32:38.750 --> 32:40.750
The interaction of two energies
creates everything.

32:40.750 --> 32:42.450
All things multiply and change endlessly.

32:42.450 --> 32:43.050
Activate!

33:03.030 --> 33:05.880
Who is fortunate enough
to join the sect today?

33:09.480 --> 33:10.740
Where is Wang Yanqing?

33:16.510 --> 33:18.510
Devout follower Wang Yanqing is here.

33:18.510 --> 33:21.440
Congratulations on the birthday
of the Phoenix God.

33:21.540 --> 33:22.400
I congratulate

33:23.110 --> 33:24.640
our God and the Sect Master.

33:24.920 --> 33:26.180
May you be as enduring as the moon,

33:26.180 --> 33:27.580
and as radiant as the sun.

33:29.440 --> 33:30.900
Report to the Phoenix God,

33:31.550 --> 33:33.080
and tell everyone present,

33:33.560 --> 33:34.400
who you are.

33:35.510 --> 33:37.570
I come from the Wang family of Jinqiu.

33:38.070 --> 33:39.590
I'm the direct heir of the Wang family.

33:39.590 --> 33:40.990
The Wang family of Jinqiu

33:41.000 --> 33:42.830
has produced cultivators in the past,

33:42.830 --> 33:45.400
so it can be considered
a family of cultivators.

33:45.400 --> 33:46.400
As far as I know,

33:46.790 --> 33:49.000
your family has always been
subordinate to the immortal sect,

33:49.000 --> 33:50.000
serving them.

33:50.480 --> 33:51.140
So why do you

33:52.160 --> 33:54.360
want to join our Qinghong Holy Sect now?

33:54.960 --> 33:56.820
You may not know this, Venerable.

33:57.420 --> 33:58.280
Over the years,

33:58.880 --> 34:00.210
our Wang family may seem

34:00.640 --> 34:02.500
to be driven by the immortal sect,

34:02.590 --> 34:03.450
but in reality,

34:04.210 --> 34:05.200
we are forced to serve

34:05.200 --> 34:06.600
by their despotic power.

34:06.850 --> 34:08.449
They are cruel and ruthless,

34:08.480 --> 34:10.409
and do not treat us as humans at all.

34:10.570 --> 34:12.830
They take whatever
they want from my family,

34:12.830 --> 34:14.550
and the slightest hesitation from us

34:14.550 --> 34:16.150
would bring fatal disaster.

34:17.590 --> 34:18.590
Who in your family

34:18.710 --> 34:20.770
has been harmed by the immortal sect?

34:21.710 --> 34:22.510
My father

34:23.360 --> 34:24.360
and elder brother

34:25.230 --> 34:27.360
were both killed by the immortal sect.

34:27.489 --> 34:28.710
Our Wang family has been driven

34:28.710 --> 34:30.570
to a dead end by the immortal sect.

34:30.750 --> 34:31.510
The reason I could

34:31.510 --> 34:32.710
find my way here today

34:32.880 --> 34:33.440
is that

34:34.190 --> 34:36.250
I felt the calling of the Phoenix God.

34:36.719 --> 34:38.830
I am willing to offer
all my family's wealth.

34:38.830 --> 34:40.489
Have mercy on me, Sect Master.

34:40.670 --> 34:42.190
Please allow me into the sect.

34:42.190 --> 34:44.120
Give me guidance and enlighten me.

34:44.670 --> 34:45.510
One day,

34:46.800 --> 34:48.530
the people of the immortal sect

34:48.739 --> 34:50.179
will pay in blood.

34:50.880 --> 34:52.230
Blood for blood!

34:52.580 --> 34:53.880
Blood for blood!

34:54.190 --> 34:55.550
Blood for blood!

34:57.230 --> 34:58.030
Wang Yanqing,

34:58.920 --> 35:00.450
were the words you just said

35:00.960 --> 35:02.220
truly from your heart?

35:02.360 --> 35:03.820
I swear to the Phoenix God,

35:04.960 --> 35:07.290
everything I, Wang Yanqing, said is true.

35:07.720 --> 35:09.180
If there is even half a lie,

35:09.440 --> 35:11.230
may I incur the wrath of gods and men,

35:11.230 --> 35:14.160
be pierced by a sword,
and die without a whole corpse.

35:15.030 --> 35:17.030
Please pass your judgment, Master.

35:17.510 --> 35:19.030
Since that is the case,

35:19.230 --> 35:20.920
I will represent you today

35:21.350 --> 35:23.310
to pray to the Phoenix God.

35:51.550 --> 35:54.320
May the Phoenix God grant us guidance.

36:40.840 --> 36:42.400
Thank you, Phoenix God.

36:43.030 --> 36:45.110
Thank you for your grace, Phoenix God.

36:45.110 --> 36:46.970
Thank you for your mercy, Master.

36:49.630 --> 36:50.550
Rise.

36:52.800 --> 36:53.760
The Phoenix God

36:54.320 --> 36:56.710
has felt your devotion.

36:57.480 --> 36:58.140
From now on,

36:58.360 --> 37:00.190
we are close siblings

37:00.440 --> 37:01.590
of the same family.

37:02.920 --> 37:05.510
The Phoenix God will bless you

37:06.000 --> 37:08.320
and guide you when you are lost.

37:08.840 --> 37:10.840
All believers of the Qinghong Sect

37:11.000 --> 37:13.590
are united with you as one,

37:14.000 --> 37:16.230
sharing life and death.

37:19.360 --> 37:20.420
Thank you, Master.

37:22.960 --> 37:26.960
You said you have a deep hatred
for the immortal sect.

37:27.440 --> 37:28.190
Today,

37:29.110 --> 37:31.280
I will use the blood of the immortal sect

37:31.280 --> 37:32.240
to baptize

37:33.070 --> 37:34.760
and bless you.

37:35.360 --> 37:37.690
I will follow your arrangements, Master.

37:37.760 --> 37:38.960
Should I seize power,

37:40.190 --> 37:42.450
I will fight the immortal sect to the end.

37:45.840 --> 37:47.970
Pick a prisoner from the immortal sect

37:48.510 --> 37:49.710
and bring them here.

37:52.360 --> 37:52.840
Yes.

37:59.440 --> 38:00.070
Senior.

38:00.590 --> 38:01.320
How are you?

38:02.190 --> 38:02.880
I'm fine.

38:03.280 --> 38:03.960
It's done.

38:05.320 --> 38:06.110
I will quickly

38:06.110 --> 38:08.260
undo the Nine Breaths Technique for you.

38:08.260 --> 38:09.300
Adjust your breath

38:09.300 --> 38:10.830
and steady yourself first.

38:15.910 --> 38:17.310
What happened to you?

38:19.030 --> 38:20.690
I had to damage my own vitality

38:20.770 --> 38:22.770
to gather the turbid qi of dead wood.

38:27.590 --> 38:28.650
Someone is coming.

38:45.110 --> 38:47.030
Look at your short-lived face.

38:47.320 --> 38:48.000
You'll do.

38:49.070 --> 38:50.200
Don't be impulsive.

38:56.190 --> 38:56.960
It's okay.

38:58.230 --> 38:59.280
I'll go.

39:00.400 --> 39:02.130
If I am lucky enough to survive,

39:02.830 --> 39:04.270
I will kill all of you.

39:05.480 --> 39:06.590
If I die,

39:07.630 --> 39:08.890
remember to avenge me.

39:10.670 --> 39:11.510
Don't rush.

39:12.020 --> 39:13.350
It'll be your turn next.

39:14.320 --> 39:14.920
Let's go.

39:55.550 --> 39:56.080
Who is it?

40:01.950 --> 40:04.010
The Blessing Ceremony is held today.

40:04.410 --> 40:06.250
What are you doing here

40:08.070 --> 40:09.880
instead of tending to sect matters?

40:09.880 --> 40:11.480
Then what are you doing here?

40:11.510 --> 40:12.440
Waiting for you.

40:14.140 --> 40:15.600
Then you are really lucky.

40:15.960 --> 40:17.160
You waited and met me.

40:18.150 --> 40:18.730
Stop!

40:26.110 --> 40:27.550
Master was right.

40:27.770 --> 40:29.250
You really are a traitor.

40:40.110 --> 40:41.110
Bring him up.

40:43.810 --> 40:44.210
Move.

40:45.040 --> 40:46.040
I can walk myself.

